      The obs-write fraction is the number to compare against a claim like
      "close to the write-bandwidth floor". It is near 100% only if the
      render kernel is bandwidth bound; if it is far below 100% while the
      obs+voxel fraction is also far below, the kernel is bound by neither
      and is DDA-latency or issue bound, which is a different claim entirely.
    
